---
// For Birdwatchers Section
---

<section class="for-birdwatchers section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Your birding memories, saved forever.</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      Join guided tours, follow the shared species list, mark your own sightings and keep every report in your personal birding history.
    </p>

    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🔗</div>
        <h3>Join by invitation link or QR</h3>
        <p>Easily join any tour through a link or quick QR code scan from your phone.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📋</div>
        <h3>Follow live species list</h3>
        <p>Watch the shared species list update in real time as the guide records sightings.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">⭐</div>
        <h3>Mark seen / photographed / favorite</h3>
        <p>Track which species you've seen, photographed, or marked as a lifer during the tour.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📚</div>
        <h3>Save personal checklists</h3>
        <p>Build your own checklists and explore birds and locations independently.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📖</div>
        <h3>Keep reports and history</h3>
        <p>Save every tour report and build a complete personal birding history over time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="for-birdwatchers-cta">
      <a href="https://followbirdsapp.web.app" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank">Download App</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .for-birdwatchers {
    background-color: #fff;
  }

  .for-birdwatchers h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: #faf9f7;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .for-birdwatchers-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
